  "steps": [
    "Corn. Stand each cob up, slice off the kernels and scrape (\"milk\") the cob for its juices.",
    "Sauté. Cook the diced onion and garlic in the olive oil until soft, then add the corn and its milk and cook until tender.*",
    "Peppers. Stir in the chopped pickled peppers and pepper juice.*",
    "Cheese. Melt in the cheddar and top with crumbled cotija. Serve warm with chips.*"
